OL,3,AThe virtual worlds where robots are
OL,4,Atrained
OL,5,
OL,6,FI'm at Vsim, a British start-up based
OL,7,Fin Cambridge. Founders Michelle Lu and
OL,8,FKier Storey hope one day their software
OL,9,Fwill control robots that can navigate
OL,10,Fand do useful tasks in the home and
OL,11,Fworkplace.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
