OL,3,APresley Gerber, Cindy Crawford's son,
OL,4,Adies aged 27
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresley Gerber, the son of supermodel
OL,7,FCindy Crawford, has died at the age of
OL,8,F27.
OL,10,FGerber, a model, died at a rehab
OL,11,Ffacility on Sunday, according to
OL,12,Frecords filed by the Los Angeles County
OL,13,FMedical Examiner. The cause of death
OL,14,Fwas not listed.
OL,16,FAllie Jenkins, a representative for
OL,17,FCrawford and her husband Rande Gerber,
OL,18,Ftold the BBC's US news partner CBS:
OL,19,F"The family is asking for privacy
OL,20,Fduring this very difficult and painful
OL,21,Ftime."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
